---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const title = "Terms of Service — Buildwise Media";
const description = "Terms governing use of buildwisemedia.com and Buildwise Media services.";
const lastUpdated = "September 2, 2026";

// JSON-LD: BreadcrumbList — Home › Terms (leaf matches the trailing-slash canonical)
const breadcrumb = {
  '@type': 'BreadcrumbList',
  itemListElement: [
    { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 1, name: 'Home', item: 'https://buildwisemedia.com/' },
    { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 2, name: 'Terms of Service', item: 'https://buildwisemedia.com/terms/' },
  ],
};
---
<!-- @r020-exempt: legal page with no visual budget -->
<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} noindex={false} jsonLd={[breadcrumb]}>

  <article class="legal-page">
    <div class="container legal-container">

      <header class="legal-head">
        <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
        <h1 class="h-hero">Terms of <em>Service</em></h1>
        <p class="legal-meta mono">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>
      </header>

      <section class="prose">
        <h2 class="h-sub">1. Agreement</h2>
        <p>By using buildwisemedia.com you agree to these terms. The website is operated by Buildwise Media LLC, a Georgia limited liability company.</p>

        <h2 class="h-sub">2. Services</h2>
        <p>Buildwise Media designs and builds custom AI systems for qualified business clients. Scope, deliverables, fees, and termination terms are governed by a separate written client agreement signed before work begins. This page does not constitute that agreement.</p>

        <h2 class="h-sub">3. Fit requests</h2>
        <p>The fit form lets you send the Buildwise team a note about the business bottleneck getting in the way of growth. We review the note and may reply by email. Sending a note does not create a client relationship, guarantee acceptance, or promise a particular response time or outcome.</p>

        <h2 class="h-sub">4. Pricing</h2>
        <p>We do not publish a standard price because each engagement is scoped around the client and the system being built. Final scope, fees, any third-party costs, and operating terms are governed by the separate written client agreement signed before work begins.</p>

        <h2 class="h-sub">5. Outcome and install commitments</h2>
        <p>Client agreements may include an initial 90-day engagement, install milestones, quality-review requirements, ownership terms, and defined performance targets or measurement rules. Ninety days describes the initial engagement term; it is not a guaranteed completion date, result, return on investment, or delivery promise. Commitments apply only when written into the signed client agreement.</p>

        <h2 class="h-sub">6. Intellectual property</h2>
        <p>The website code, design, copy, logos, and trademarks on this site are owned by Buildwise Media LLC. Client-owned assets created during paid work are owned by the respective client per the services agreement.</p>

        <h2 class="h-sub">7. Disclaimers</h2>
        <p>Information on this website is provided as-is. We strive for accuracy but make no warranty about specific outcomes. Past results referenced on the Results page are not a guarantee of future performance.</p>

        <h2 class="h-sub">8. Limitation of liability</h2>
        <p>To the maximum extent permitted by law, Buildwise Media's liability arising from website use is limited to the greater of $100 or the fees paid by you to Buildwise Media in the 12 months preceding the claim.</p>

        <h2 class="h-sub">9. Text messaging terms</h2>
        <p><strong>Program:</strong> Buildwise Media Client Support. Invited existing clients may opt in to recurring one-to-one SMS/MMS messages about requests they send to Buildwise Media. Messages may acknowledge a request, ask a brief project question, provide a status update, or deliver a review or completion link. Messages are one-to-one customer support and project updates, not bulk promotional messaging.</p>
        <p><strong>Frequency and charges:</strong> Message frequency varies with your requests and active projects. Message and data rates may apply.</p>
        <p><strong>Help and opt-out:</strong> Reply <strong>HELP</strong> for help, <strong>STOP</strong> to unsubscribe, or <strong>START</strong> to resubscribe. You may also contact <a href="mailto:hello@buildwisemedia.com">hello@buildwisemedia.com</a> or call <a href="tel:+14786063370">+1 (478) 606-3370</a>. Consent is not a condition of purchase.</p>
        <p>Carriers are not liable for delayed or undelivered messages. Our <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a> explains how mobile information and messaging consent are handled. Do not send patient or health information, passwords, payment-card details, government identifiers, or other high-risk data by text.</p>

        <h2 class="h-sub">10. Governing law</h2>
        <p>These terms are governed by the laws of the State of Georgia, USA, without regard to conflict-of-laws principles.</p>

        <h2 class="h-sub">11. Changes</h2>
        <p>We may update these terms when our practices change. The "Last updated" date at the top reflects the most recent revision. Continued use of the website after a revision constitutes acceptance of the revised terms.</p>

        <h2 class="h-sub">12. Contact</h2>
        <p>Questions about these terms: <a href="mailto:hello@buildwisemedia.com">hello@buildwisemedia.com</a></p>

        <h2 class="h-sub">13. Data processing</h2>
        <p>Website and form data are handled under the Privacy Policy, including the listed sub-processors used for analytics, hosting, email delivery, backend records, and AI-assisted internal production.</p>
      </section>

    </div>
  </article>

</BaseLayout>

<style>
.legal-page { padding-top: clamp(140px, 14vw, 180px); padding-bottom: var(--section-y); }
.legal-container { max-width: 760px; }
.legal-head { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; margin-bottom: 56px; padding-bottom: 32px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule); }
.legal-meta { font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.18em; color: var(--ink-faint); }

.prose h2 { margin-top: 48px; margin-bottom: 16px; }
.prose p { margin-bottom: 18px; }
</style>
